    <string name="about_body">BenSuet Stay e thuša baithuti ba Afrika Borwa go hwetša bodulo bjo bo bolokegilego le bjo bo netefaditšwego kgauswi le khamphase ya bona, ka dikgetho tša NSFAS le tša go itefelela lefelong le tee. E agilwe ke Mansuet Dev.</string>
    <string name="osm_attribution">Mabaka a šomiša data ya mafelo © bafahloši ba OpenStreetMap (Nominatim).</string>
    <string name="delete_account">Phumola akhaonte ya ka</string>
    <string name="delete_account_subtitle">Tloša ka mo go sa felego profaele ya gago le go tsena</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Phumola akhaonte ya gago?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Se se phumola ka mo go sa felego profaele ya gago ya BenSuet Stay le go tsena. Se se ka se bušetšwe morago.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">Akhaonte ya gago e phumotšwe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">BenSuet Stay e kgoboketša feela seo e se hlokago go kopanya baithuti le bodulo.\n\nSeo re se kgoboketšago: leina la gago, imeile, aterese ya gae, sehlongwa le mohuta wa thekgo. Ge o dira kgopelo ya phapoši re boloka gape nomoro ya gago ya boitsebišo ya SA, nomoro ya moithuti, khamphase, dintlha tša wa leloko wa kgauswi le maina a ditokumente tšeo o di kgethilego. Go beng ba dintlo: leina, imeile le nomoro ya mogala.\n\nKa lebaka la eng: go bontšha madulo a a swanetšego, go dumelela beng ba dintlo go šoma ka dipono le dikgopelo tša gago, le go go romela dimpshafatšo ka tšona.\n\nKe mang yo a ka di bonago: ke wena fela, mong wa ntlo wa bodulo bjoo o ikgokaganyago le bjona, le balaodi ba BenSuet Stay. Melao ya tšhireletšo ya polokelo ya rena ya data e netefatša se.\n\nMo di bolokwago: Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, selete sa Johannesburg). Diphasewete di laolwa ke Firebase Authentication gomme ga di bolokwe ke app.\n\nDitokelo tša gago ka fase ga POPIA: o ka bona le go mpshafatša dintlha tša gago go Dipeakanyo, gomme wa phumola akhaonte ya gago nako efe goba efe go Dipeakanyo → Sephiri → Phumola akhaonte ya ka. Go tše dingwe, šomiša Dipeakanyo → Thušo → Ikgokaganye le thekgo.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ke beeletša bjang go bona lefelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Bula papatšo gomme o kgotle Beeletša go bona, ke moka o kgethe letšatšikgwedi le nako. Mong wa ntlo o a e tiišetša goba o a e gana, gomme o hwetša tsebišo ka mokgwa ofe goba ofe.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ke dira bjang kgopelo ya phapoši?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Bula papatšo, kgetha mohuta wa phapoši gomme o kgotle Kgetha phapoši. Baithuti ba NSFAS ba tiišetša dintlha tša bona tša NSFAS; bao ba itefelelago ba oketša dintlha tša wa leloko wa kgauswi le ditokumente tša bona. E latele go Dipeakanyo → Dikgopelo tša ka.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">Na nka šomiša app ntle le inthanete?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Ee. Dipapatšo tšeo o šetšego o di butše di dula di bonagala, gomme dikgopelo tša go bona goba dikgopelo tšeo o di dirilego o se inthaneteng di bolokwa mogaleng wa gago gomme di romelwa ka bowona ge o kgokagana gape.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Ke ka lebaka la eng ke sa bone madulo ka moka?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Letlakala la gae le thoma ka mohuta wa gago wa thekgo le Kgauswi le khamphase ya ka e butšwe. Kgotla Ka moka goba Kgauswi le khamphase ya ka go katološa nyako, goba o fetole se go Dipeakanyo → Sekirini sa gae.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ke mang yo a hlamago le go fetola dipapatšo tša ka?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Sehlopha sa balaodi ba BenSuet Stay se hlama dipapatšo gomme se di abela wena. Go fetola papatšo goba dintlha tša gago, šomiša Ikgokaganye le thekgo, goba Kgopela phetogo ka fase ga Tshedimošo ya motho.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ke šoma bjang ka dikgopelo tša go bona?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Bula Dipeeletšo gomme o tiišetše goba o gane kgopelo e nngwe le e nngwe. Ge o gana, efa lebaka gomme o šišinye nako ye nngwe. Moithuti o tsebišwa gona bjale.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Go direga eng ge ke dumela kgopelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Lefelo le tee le tlošwa mohuteng woo wa phapoši ka bowona, gomme moithuti o bona ntlha ya gago go Dikgopelo tša ka.</string>
</resources>
